{
  "id": "dumbbell",
  "nameEn": "Dumbbell",
  "nameJa": "ダンベル",
  "descriptionEn": "Two unit disks centred at (±1.3, 0) connected by a rectangular neck of half-width 0.25. Classical example for the appearance of near-degenerate eigenpairs as the neck narrows (Arrieta–Hale–Han 1991; Jimbo 1989).",
  "descriptionJa": "中心 (±1.3, 0) の単位円板 2 つを、幅 0.5 の長方形の頸部で連結した領域。頸部を細くする極限で固有値がほぼ縮退する古典例 (Arrieta–Hale–Han 1991; Jimbo 1989)。",
  "category": "collapsing",
  "reference": "Jimbo, J. Diff. Eq. 77 (1989); Arrieta, J. Diff. Eq. 118 (1995).",
  "familyId": null,
